  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pollinator Protectors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Native pollinators are necessary to ensure healthy habitats and foods for people. However, native pollinators and the plants they rely on face significant habitat loss and other threats, including pesticide impacts and a changing climate. In parallel, due to government and corporate policies, many marginalized neighborhoods have been cut off from healthy, thriving biodiversity. ESC works with local residents and leaders to restore pollinator habitats and bring biodiversity back to communities.</narrative>
  </description>
